# Bootstrap package for user-related application-level concerns.
#
# The User aggregate root is owned by the devflow-auth module:
#   com.devflow.modules.auth.domain.User
#
# This package is reserved for application-level user concerns that
# are cross-cutting (e.g., current user context resolution, user
# profile caching layer, self-service endpoint adapters).
#
# Reference: docs/architecture/DOMAIN_MODEL.md §3.1
